meta:
  title: About
  description: An unlisted reading room for articles that are difficult to find.
  og_image: /og-default.png

options: null

content:
  heading: About
  paragraphs[2]:
    - "Some Unblocked Content is an intentionally unlisted reading room that relays or restores a handful of articles that are otherwise hard to reach: paywalled, splintered into ad-stuffed slideshows, broken by login dialogs, delisted, broken, or otherwise lost. The site itself is blocked from search engines, it is intended for limited, personal use."
    - "Nothing here is rewritten or summarized. The original author, publication, and source URL sit at the top of every post. If a publisher or author would like a piece removed, we will (although it should not have been disseminated at all)."
